### ====================================================================
### Bookstore REST API - HTTP Client Collection (SIS 3)
### Covers: OpenAPI /v3/api-docs, Swagger UI, External OpenLibrary Calls
###         (Timeouts + Retries + Fallback), Cached Read Endpoints,
###         and CRUD Operations Triggering @Audited + Kafka BookEvents
### ====================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1/books

### 1. [GET] OpenAPI 3.0 JSON Specification (springdoc-openapi)
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### 2. [GET] Swagger UI HTML Page
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html
Accept: text/html

### 3. [GET] External Service Call #1: Enrich stored book (id=1) with OpenLibrary metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/1/external-metadata
Accept: application/json

### 4. [GET] External Service Call #2: Query OpenLibrary directly by ISBN (Clean Code: 9780132350884)
GET {{baseUrl}}/external/isbn/9780132350884
Accept: application/json

### 5. [GET] External Service Call #3: Unknown ISBN -> Triggers graceful fallback response (HTTP 200, fallback=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/external/isbn/0000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 6. [GET] Read-Heavy Endpoint: Get Book by ID (Cached via Caffeine)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. [GET] Read-Heavy Endpoint: Full Book Catalog (Cached via Caffeine)
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog
Accept: application/json

### 8. [GET] Paginated Books
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=0&size=5&sort=id,asc
Accept: application/json

### 9. [POST] Create a new Book -> Triggers @Audited(CREATE_BOOK) & Kafka BookEvent(CREATED)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Microservices in Action",
  "author": "John Carnell",
  "isbn": "9781617293986",
  "price": 49.99,
  "publicationYear": 2017,
  "description": "Resilient microservice patterns with Spring Boot"
}

### 10. [PUT] Update Book -> Triggers @Audited(UPDATE_BOOK), @CachePut & Kafka BookEvent(UPDATED)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code (Updated Edition)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "price": 42.50,
  "publicationYear": 2008,
  "description": "A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship"
}

### 11. [DELETE] Delete Book -> Triggers @Audited(DELETE_BOOK), @CacheEvict & Kafka BookEvent(DELETED)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/2
Accept: application/json
